      "pilihan": {
        "a": "Betul, [[kelipatan-2025-08-01-2025-10-08|22,25 kali]] harga [[harga-2025-08-01|1 Agustus]].",
        "b": "Betul, naiknya karena dividen tunai [[div-2025-09-16|Rp0,14]] per lembar.",
        "c": "Keliru, harga [[harga-2025-10-08|8 Oktober]] masih [[harga-2025-08-01|Rp8]] per lembar, sama seperti awal.",
